# The build context is the repo root, whose .dockerignore excludes ai/ and apis/
# entirely - which would make the COPY lines in Dockerfile fail. BuildKit uses
# this file instead of the root one for this Dockerfile: exclude everything,
# then allow only what the Dockerfile copies.
*
!apis/ffv_api/requirements.txt
!apis/ffv_api/main.py
!ai/ajrasakha/ffv/scripts/generate_ffvs.py
